    {
      "source": "Implements the <a href=\"../ConfigurableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ConfigurableWebApplicationContext</code></a>\ninterface to allow for direct replacement of an <a href=\"XmlWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>XmlWebApplicationContext</code></a>,\ndespite not actually supporting external configuration files.",
